OL,3,GNEWSAOver 100 new homes refused over
OL,4,Aflood risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FA proposal to build up to 112 homes in
OL,7,Fa rural east Surrey village has been
OL,8,Frefused after planning officers flagged
OL,9,Fconcerns over the site's flood risk.
OL,11,FDevelopers had applied to Tandridge
OL,12,FDistrict Council (TDC) for outline
OL,13,Fplanning permission on land off
OL,14,FCrowhurst Road in Lingfield.
OL,16,FThe firm said its plans would have
OL,17,Fhelped address the "chronic and
OL,18,Fsubstantial housing supply shortfall
OL,19,Fand affordability issues" in the area.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
