OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents objecting to the scheme also
OL,7,Fcited its impact on local
OL,8,Finfrastructure and the surrounding
OL,9,Fcountryside, with one calling it a
OL,10,F"total disaster for our lovely
OL,11,Fvillage".
